    {
     "speaker": "Operator",
     "role": "Operator",
     "text": "Good afternoon and welcome to the Bank of America Corporation Q1 2024 earnings conference call. All participants will be in listen-only mode. Please note this event is being recorded."
    },
    {
     "speaker": "Dana Whitfield",
     "role": "Chief Executive Officer",
     "text": "Bank of America Corporation closed Q1 2024 with demand broadly in line with the plan we laid out ninety days ago, and we exited the quarter with the cost base we committed to."
    },
    {
     "speaker": "Miren Okafor",
     "role": "Chief Financial Officer",
     "text": "Net interest income was $24.9 billion for the quarter and the net interest margin was 2.0%. Provision for credit losses was $1,123 million, and our CET1 ratio ended the period at 12.7%."
    },
    {
     "speaker": "Priya Raghunathan",
     "role": "Analyst, Ridgeline Research",
     "text": "Thanks for taking the question. Can you walk through how much of the 2.0% move is mix versus pricing, and whether you expect the same input costs to carry into next quarter?"
    }
   ],
   "committed_receipt_text": "Provision for credit losses was $1,123 million, and our CET1 ratio ended the period at 12.7%."
